  <RhinoForgeState presetName="Talking Growl" presetAuthor="Rhino Forge" presetStyle="Bass" presetNotes="The organ frame chewed towards the voice frame, phase-distorted by a sub an octave down, then spoken through the formant filter: LFO 1 moves the mouth between E and O every beat, LFO 2 works the table and the grit in eighths. Layer a sub under it. Macro 1 is the grit, macro 2 the vowel." macroName_1="GRIT" macroName_2="VOWEL">
